Thanks for all the advice.  Seems like the concenus is that I do have a
very ascendable wizard at this point.  I am pretty patient and
appreciate all the tools I have at my disposal, like MB engraving and a
minotaur.

Some take aways:

XL is pretty key at this point.  Eye at 14, Warning at 15 and TC at 17
make an XL sprint worth it.

Lack of reflection is a serious gap so unusual steps are worth taking
to solve it, including dipping, laying eggs, diving for the castle wand
or farming for drops.  A cube gave me ShR since my first posting but a
few more would be nice.

The next single wish could go for SDSM or an artifact such as PYEC or
the EotO (KoMT is chaotic BTW).  I'm leaning towards dipping for SDSM
because it eliminates a set of real risks rather than providing backup
to ones already covered (x2).  The second wish may still allow for an
artifact.  I can handle water demons and snakes.

Lack of a healing spell and RC are unfortunate.  MMs could go to
?oGeno, ?oEA, +oH(EH), +oTU, +oRC

I already have an Incubus to dance with but the success rate with 18
Int and 11 Cha is lower than I'd like.  He did get me to XL11 since I
last posted.  Magic trap boogie is a good idea.  I haven't found a
singal !oGA but if I do of course I'll bless and quaff.  Int, Dex, Wis
and Con are at or close to 18 so giants and magic traps can fill in the
rest.

Lots of equipment configurations to consider.  RNG will probably chose
some of it for me.



